{"id":"mida-de-la-imatge-atributs-html-i-css-inline","title":"Mida de la imatge _ atributs HTML i CSS inline","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":63,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Pots controlar la mida d&#39;una imatge de dues maneres: directament amb els atributs <code>width</code> i <code>height</code> de l&#39;HTML, o bé utilitzant l&#39;atribut <code>style</code> per aplicar CSS directament (inline). Si només definim l&#39;amplada i posem l&#39;alçada en <code>auto</code>, el navegador mantindrà la proporció original i la imatge no es deformarà.</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;paisaje.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Paisaje&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;300&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;paisaje.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;width: 300px; height: 200px;&quot;</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}